{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:2387eb3eb8af74b8","name":"Laminanium Heavy Plating","source":{"id":"source:reference-2387eb3eb8af74b8","title":"Laminanium Heavy Plating","revision":21062,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:05:28Z","sha256":"72edc8c4684e09ebffa1556f861b0191d276e43e13f6f40618adf5bf50516ae4","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21062","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Laminanium%20Heavy%20Plating&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-2387eb3eb8af74b8","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 20,000 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Factor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Factor"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," (15 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Factor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Factor"},") Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rare"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rare"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Made from an exclusive Laminanium alloy developed by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tendrando Arms"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tendrando_Arms","referenceId":"reference:32bdf02c837d4e55"},", Laminanium Plating is primarily for use on its ",{"tag":"a","children":["YVH-Series Battle Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/YVH-Series_Battle_Droids?action=edit&redlink=1"},". The unique properties of the self-repairing qellan metal enable it to spontaneously melt and reform to seal damaged areas, even at standard room temperature. The armor is more durable than other types of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.